              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Metadata is untrusted input. It is parsed at the boundary and JSON-quoted in instructions, and it only unlocks actions any agent can already take with bb thread. The task link also lives in bb Tasks' own thread attachment."
